        answer_en: "**Affinity Designer V3 is the absolute undisputed king of Isometric Illustration (3D dimensional drawings using mathematically perfect 30-degree axes)!**\n\nStop manually calculating 3D skew angles:\n1. Open View > **Grid and Axis**. Enable the Grid and change the mode to `Isometric`. A comprehensive 3D wireframe grid will instantly overlay your canvas.\n2. Open the dedicated **Isometric Panel** from your Studio layout.\n3. The panel isolates three active drawing planes: **Top, Front, and Side**.\n\n🪄 **The Magic Feature (Fit to Plane):** You can design a highly complex mobile UI screen or typographic poster perfectly flat in 2D. Group it, select it, and tap the **'Fit to Plane'** button in the Isometric Panel. Your flat 2D artwork is instantaneously, mathematically projected onto the active 3D isometric grid plane with flawless perspective accuracy!",
