        answer: "បាទ **Isometric Panel គឺជាមុខងារកំពូលមួយរបស់ Affinity សម្រាប់ការគូររូប 3D (អគារ ហ្គេម ឬ UI) ដោយប្រើទម្រង់ 2D!**\n\n១. ចូលទៅកាន់ **View > Studio > Isometric**។\n២. ចុចប៊ូតុង **'Modify Grid'** រួចជ្រើសរើស **Isometric** (មុំ ៣០ ដឺក្រេ) នោះអេក្រង់អ្នកនឹងចេញក្រឡា 3D។\n៣. នៅក្នុង Isometric Panel អ្នកនឹងមានប៊ូតុងទិសដៅ ៣៖ **Top (ខាងលើ), Front (ខាងមុខ), និង Side (ចំហៀង)**។\n៤. ពេលអ្នកជ្រើសរើសទិសដៅណាមួយ ឧ. 'Top' ហើយអ្នកគូររូបការ៉េមួយ រូបការ៉េនោះនឹងត្រូវបញ្ចោតខ្លួន (Skew) ឱ្យត្រូវនឹងប្លង់ 3D ពីលើដោយស្វ័យប្រវត្តិ!\n\n💡 **Fit to Plane:** បើអ្នកមាន Logo ឬអក្សរធម្មតា ហើយចង់បិទវាទៅលើជញ្ជាំង 3D គ្រាន់តែរើសទិសដៅ (ឧ. Side) រួចចុចប៊ូតុង **'Fit to Plane'** នោះអក្សររបស់អ្នកនឹងបត់ចូលជញ្ជាំង 3D ភ្លាមៗតែម្តង!",
        answer_en: "**The Isometric Panel is Affinity's dedicated mathematical engine for projecting flat 2D vectors into flawless isometric 3D space!**\n\nEssential for architectural drafting, tech-UI mockups, and mobile game asset design:\n1. Open **View > Studio > Isometric**.\n2. Click **'Modify Grid'** and select **Isometric** (which enforces strict 30-degree orthographic projection angles). A 3D grid instantly overlays your canvas.\n3. The Isometric Panel controls the Current Plane. You can toggle between **Top, Front, and Side** planes.\n4. When a plane (e.g., 'Top') is active, drawing a standard Rectangle instantly projects and skews that rectangle into a perfect 3D floor tile, snapping flawlessly to the isometric grid!\n\n💡 **Fit to Plane:** If you have already designed a flat, complex UI screen or typography block and want to mock it up in 3D, simply select the UI group, choose your target plane on the panel (e.g., 'Front'), and click the **'Fit to Plane'** button. The entire complex group instantly warps into perfect isometric perspective!",
